{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04271","headline":"四月八日题七级 · 骆宾王","name":"四月八日题七级","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"化城分鸟堞，香阁俯龙川。\n复栋侵黄道，重檐架紫烟。\n铭书非晋代，壁画是梁年。\n霸略今何在，王宫尚岿然。\n二帝曾游圣，三卿是偶贤。\n因兹游胜侣，超彼托良缘。\n我出有爲界，君登非想天。\n悠悠青旷里，荡荡白云前。\n今日经行处，曲音号盖烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}